      "trackName": "Dino Run: Watch Arcade Game",
      "description": "Bored? Waiting in line? Play instantly on your wrist! No iPhone required.\n\nDino Run is the ultimate arcade survival game tailored specifically for Apple Watch. Just tap, jump, and dodge. Simple, addictive, and perfect for killing time.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT:\n\nInstant Action: Launches in milliseconds.\n\nNative Watch Experience: Optimized for Series 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, SE & Ultra.\n\n100% Offline: Play on airplanes, subways, or anywhere without internet.\n\nDigital Crown Support: Scroll or tap to control your T-Rex.\n\nRetro Pixel Art: Classic nostalgia style on your OLED screen.\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n\nTap the screen to jump.\n\nAvoid cacti and obstacles.\n\nBeat your high score.\n\nStop staring at a blank watch face. Download Dino Run now and turn your wrist into a retro arcade machine!",
